{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6S74NK1JAAZ1GZJF1GDT379"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NK1JAAZ1GZJF1GDT379"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK2JRM0FNC60HQ7S1FZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK3A3R3C26D7ZVS335J"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK43HMDHEJ17J4GT71J"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK5BRMAH9GSPT4YRK7E"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK6C7H3A365CHGSJDWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK7J7H39TPTA2Y9N3BM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK877C0ZCER2WWRPH49"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK9X5SJVFYYNZ99SXZT"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKA3S9S10B9FH9B62EN"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKBNAQV7HK94ZZMMA1B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKC65H2NV5H68FD5ZXM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKDMZ60A9565CK5JCS9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKEA3WTAP9D919XBPEE"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKFZ1PS82XF7ZK69762"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKG5RMHWN14GHT0W5ZQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKHZ93RP5C45FZ5G9E1"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKJH7CGW22BV3RX05N7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKKP72QGPAWX8ERQ529"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKM4P6QZKFX92CEP9BM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKN6XWQKV5J6S2VTH5Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKP9M94GJ9BF0QN5RK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKQE6Y77PE38Q4WZJQZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKRA92MV0RJTQ01RGQH"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKSTQ71D1WKJW9AK7VN"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKTYSAS4P2CRBF06BSB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKVFRFF217MRACJJFEP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKWB85DNWQN6BH1BWF5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKXKJKC1Q27PV7GPKEE"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKYQZNFKPED13V334XP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKZW2NBES60GJ3MSV05"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM089PVSZV5CJ402BG4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM1R643RG7NSF2H1CXW"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM2D4RQABPF313N5ZZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM3XPTGKEDGGMFFYB04"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM496H4PAPC2P9W5T1W"}]},"id":"01M6S74NM51X6JC5J1QYJDEZ9Y","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-04","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what each part is missing, and who covers it","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NK2JRM0FNC60HQ7S1FZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK3A3R3C26D7ZVS335J"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK43HMDHEJ17J4GT71J"}],"prose":"The paper builds a system in which every part is defined by something it cannot do alone, and another part is made to cover it. Even the part that binds the rest is described as wanting a guide. The whole is then rehearsed in simulation and set down on a countryside where the lack is literal: places with no way to travel.","title":"A whole made of supplied lacks"},"id":"01M6S74NK1JAAZ1GZJF1GDT379","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the match between a shortfall and its remedy","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NK5BRMAH9GSPT4YRK7E"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKA3S9S10B9FH9B62EN"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKHZ93RP5C45FZ5G9E1"}],"prose":"Read as a ledger, the framework lists shortfalls of autonomous systems, then gives each one a specialised holon, then adds a binding holon because the specialists cannot coordinate themselves.","title":"The economy of lack"},"id":"01M6S74NK2JRM0FNC60HQ7S1FZ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which incapacity is being named","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NK6C7H3A365CHGSJDWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK7J7H39TPTA2Y9N3BM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK877C0ZCER2WWRPH49"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NK9X5SJVFYYNZ99SXZT"}],"prose":"Four kinds of missing capacity are named for autonomous systems: they break when conditions shift, they carry bias, they have no account of responsibility, and they see only their own corner.","title":"The shortfalls named"},"id":"01M6S74NK5BRMAH9GSPT4YRK7E","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"change at runtime","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S0957APBWA2W6N7RK4HA1J"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"}],"prose":"Fixed models and fixed interfaces do not survive heterogeneous systems meeting at runtime.","title":"Brittle under change"},"id":"01M6S74NK6C7H3A365CHGSJDWR","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"fairness and accountability","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S091HFR7QY67Y0XKA5J0DF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"}],"prose":"Decisions inherit bias from data and design, and nothing in them reasons about harm or blame.","title":"Without conscience"},"id":"01M6S74NK7J7H39TPTA2Y9N3BM","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"shared context","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"}],"prose":"A part may interpret its own data well and still be misaligned with the collective it serves.","title":"Locally informed, globally blind"},"id":"01M6S74NK877C0ZCER2WWRPH49","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"time horizon of a goal","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"}],"prose":"Optimising for speed and resource use overlooks longer consequences.","title":"The short horizon"},"id":"01M6S74NK9X5SJVFYYNZ99SXZT","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the mechanism each remedy relies on","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NKBNAQV7HK94ZZMMA1B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKC65H2NV5H68FD5ZXM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKDMZ60A9565CK5JCS9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKEA3WTAP9D919XBPEE"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKFZ1PS82XF7ZK69762"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKG5RMHWN14GHT0W5ZQ"}],"prose":"Each shortfall gets a holon kind, each with a mechanism, two example domains and a pair of open problems. Together they are meant to check and feed one another.","title":"Remedies cast as holons"},"id":"01M6S74NKA3S9S10B9FH9B62EN","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who defines the rules","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"}],"prose":"Ethics is written down as ontologies and rules and weighed against operational aims; deciding which guidelines to write is left as the hard part.","title":"Encoded morals"},"id":"01M6S74NKBNAQV7HK94ZZMMA1B","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"a metric for consequences","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093PESAZNQ254MP8QMHMG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"}],"prose":"Effectiveness is multi-criteria utility over time, but how to measure it remains open.","title":"Weighing the longer term"},"id":"01M6S74NKC65H2NV5H68FD5ZXM","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the quality of the ontology","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"}],"prose":"Ontologies and semantic reasoning turn heterogeneous inputs into situational knowledge, at the price of building and maintaining those ontologies.","title":"Making sense of mixed data"},"id":"01M6S74NKDMZ60A9565CK5JCS9","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"detecting bias as it happens","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094EZEHMWPGCTN09CMTBK"},{"$ref":"01M6S094G14MVA149MAHGZ3JBG"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"}],"prose":"Catalogues of known bias patterns, fairness constraints and audits are folded into decision loops, borrowing the logic of fault detection.","title":"Catching bias"},"id":"01M6S74NKEA3WTAP9D919XBPEE","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"awareness that crosses levels","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094QH86CGJ2VPFEPRMBRA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094RFB8ZYRDV9DDW98ERX"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"}],"prose":"Distributed sensing and awareness models spread what is happening across levels, so local acts can be checked against the whole.","title":"Shared watchfulness"},"id":"01M6S74NKFZ1PS82XF7ZK69762","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow between remedies","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094Z5HFC2AJXX9P288K6H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased holons pass judgements to effective ones, understanding feeds both, and vigilance watches every layer.","title":"The remedies feed each other"},"id":"01M6S74NKG5RMHWN14GHT0W5ZQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"connecting without imposing a common form","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NKJH7CGW22BV3RX05N7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKKP72QGPAWX8ERQ529"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKM4P6QZKFX92CEP9BM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKN6XWQKV5J6S2VTH5Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKP9M94GJ9BF0QN5RK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKQE6Y77PE38Q4WZJQZ"}],"prose":"Because the specialists cannot align themselves, a federated interoperability holon is added to connect them without a common model. It is itself a holon, staffed by the very kinds it coordinates.","title":"The binder that is also bound"},"id":"01M6S74NKHZ93RP5C45FZ5G9E1","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much uniformity is imposed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HBYZ649HND3ZYXDXYT"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HYCF58A43XBQ8GAQ7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KGFWMBWNW19K2CKDZC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095NRWBNYWJEQPXGFXTC5"},{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"}],"prose":"Of three ways to make systems talk, one standard format and one shared layer both bind every part; only federation lets each keep its own form.","title":"Why no common language"},"id":"01M6S74NKJH7CGW22BV3RX05N7","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"}],"prose":"Instead of one lasting ontology, small ones are made for a task, used and dropped, so newcomers can be understood at runtime.","title":"Meaning made for the occasion"},"id":"01M6S74NKKP72QGPAWX8ERQ529","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what the binder borrows from its parts","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"}],"prose":"The binder lacks its own sense of when to act, so it takes the other kinds into itself: unbiased holons for retrieval, ethical ones as validation, vigilant ones as orchestrators.","title":"Staffed by the specialists"},"id":"01M6S74NKM4P6QZKFX92CEP9BM","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which component carries the autonomy","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"}],"prose":"Six components, with a language model at the head, a capability graph of known elements, and workflows generated and run; dropping the last two leaves it only able to steer, not to connect.","title":"Anatomy of the binder"},"id":"01M6S74NKN6XWQKV5J6S2VTH5Q","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the boundary of the contribution","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"}],"prose":"It takes on meaning and organisation and leaves technical plumbing assumed, calling itself a coordination above holons rather than their replacement.","title":"What the binder claims and declines"},"id":"01M6S74NKP9M94GJ9BF0QN5RK8","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the price of scale","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S096929EE6AD520SWDPK4N"},{"$ref":"01M6S098NTTHF9ESCJ8CYMNPR9"},{"$ref":"01M6S098Q89NK293FCZ3EYNTNC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098WFFJ09R57JCXQAZAM3"},{"$ref":"01M6S098YF407XTYGG61RBEPZ7"}],"prose":"Standards that require consensus, load that grows with every holon, and sensitive exchanges that must be secured.","title":"What binding costs"},"id":"01M6S74NKQE6Y77PE38Q4WZJQZ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority settles","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NKRA92MV0RJTQ01RGQH"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKSTQ71D1WKJW9AK7VN"}],"prose":"Autonomy is praised throughout, yet authority keeps collecting at the top. The inherited idea of a holon and the paper's own architecture both lean toward a pyramid with a highest authority.","title":"The shape of command"},"id":"01M6S74NK3A3R3C26D7ZVS335J","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what the idea carries in from its past","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S090806VNZVA97AV0V0XD2"},{"$ref":"01M6S090GX8FSDRJ0E4TJ1H3DX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"},{"$ref":"01M6S090PDBF0YZFN6YMV9WJ5W"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YV85BZVM4G694CQKMYX"}],"prose":"From Koestler through manufacturing to grids and construction, the holon arrives already carrying a hierarchy in which higher levels direct lower ones within bounded freedom.","title":"An inheritance of nested authority"},"id":"01M6S74NKRA92MV0RJTQ01RGQH","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much freedom the top leaves below","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZT4PVPYCGQYJV7PR3M5"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"Holons keep local discretion, yet in the built system one holon holds the highest authority and may restructure the rest.","title":"Autonomy held under a summit"},"id":"01M6S74NKSTQ71D1WKJW9AK7VN","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the claim reaches beyond its evidence","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NKTYSAS4P2CRBF06BSB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKYQZNFKPED13V334XP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM2D4RQABPF313N5ZZJ"}],"prose":"The construction is tested three ways: by letting it direct its own rehearsal, by casting it onto rural transport, and, unintentionally, by the seams in the text that show what is still unfinished.","title":"Trying the whole"},"id":"01M6S74NK43HMDHEJ17J4GT71J","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who steers the simulation","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NKVFRFF217MRACJJFEP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKWB85DNWQN6BH1BWF5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NKXKJKC1Q27PV7GPKEE"}],"prose":"Simulation is not only a place where holons are modelled; holons may steer how the simulation runs, and the deployed system can be mirrored into an HLA federation that checks it.","title":"A system that directs its own rehearsal"},"id":"01M6S74NKTYSAS4P2CRBF06BSB","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what holons add to agents","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"}],"prose":"The categories of agent-directed simulation are carried over to holons, adding nested levels to emergent behaviour.","title":"From agents to holons"},"id":"01M6S74NKVFRFF217MRACJJFEP","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"depth of intervention in the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"},{"$ref":"01M6S092VYEKZR8236TWY9GTNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092WW0PH5GJ4A54XXD3EV"}],"prose":"Holons may only supply data, or react, or learn, or rewrite the rules and objectives of the run.","title":"Degrees of steering"},"id":"01M6S74NKWB85DNWQN6BH1BWF5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between system and twin","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"}],"prose":"Each holon gets a federate twin, a reduced copy of the binder manages the run, and faults are flagged upward and end in a scored analysis.","title":"The federation as mirror"},"id":"01M6S74NKXKJKC1Q27PV7GPKEE","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"absence of service as a place on a map","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NKZW2NBES60GJ3MSV05"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM089PVSZV5CJ402BG4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM1R643RG7NSF2H1CXW"}],"prose":"The framework lands where lack is literal: sparse places, costly services, and areas with no transport at all, which the system is meant to find as well as serve.","title":"Rural ground"},"id":"01M6S74NKYQZNFKPED13V334XP","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"finding where nothing runs","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099CXGHQV3WHYC9KRGE4P"},{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099K16DKC7EQQ35ANCYXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"Beyond routing trips, the platform locates areas no transport reaches, reported upward by watching and understanding holons.","title":"Deserts as gaps to be found"},"id":"01M6S74NKZW2NBES60GJ3MSV05","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which kind each actor plays","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2VW9MCRGFVA05NDNK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3PSM31D58SR50QBDQS"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3Q6P77FKPS24YHHCNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5BW0BNN3HVZ12K0BPE"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"}],"prose":"Travellers, transport services, infrastructure and communication each become one or more of the proposed kinds, all synchronised by the binder.","title":"Roles cast onto actors"},"id":"01M6S74NM089PVSZV5CJ402BG4","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the benefit asserted","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09BAGXSGTE19VJ36NDS5M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BD7Q7DNEGX5EB0MJ8HK"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BEWR9X5Z7H9RYYS9WNB"}],"prose":"Scalability, responsiveness, equitable access and lower emissions are claimed for the scheme.","title":"Goods promised for the case"},"id":"01M6S74NM1R643RG7NSF2H1CXW","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
